.TH SPPDOCS-STORAGE-MIGRATE 1 "September 2026" "SPP CLI Manual" "SPP System Documentation"
.SH NAME
sppdocs:storage:migrate \- Migrate SPPDocs project issues between Flat-File JSON and SQLite storage
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php sppdocs:storage:migrate
\fB\-\-project\fR=\fIproject-id\fR
[\fB\-\-to\fR=\fIsqlite|json\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sppdocs:storage:migrate
converts all issue data, comments, time logs, and milestones for a specified SPPDocs project between flat-file JSON and indexed SQLite WAL storage without downtime or data corruption.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-project= "project-id"
Identifier of the project configured under docs/<project-id>/project.yml.
.TP
.BI \-\-to= "sqlite|json"
Target storage engine format. Default is sqlite.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
The command scans the source directory, invokes the respective StorageDriver classes, transfers all records within an atomic transaction, updates project.yml, and regenerates index caches.
